The legal text is the Constitución Política de la República de Panamá as printed in the Asamblea Nacional edition of
April 2024 (https://asamblea.gob.pa/Uploads/GestorFiles/Reglamento_Organico_del_Regimen_Interno.pdf), retrieved
29 October 2026. The site states no licence.

The Código Penal text is the Texto Único del Código Penal de la República de Panamá published by the Procuraduría General de
la Nación (https://ministeriopublico.gob.pa/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/CODIGO-PENAL-2019-FINAL-1.pdf), retrieved
30 October 2026. The site states no licence.

The Código Procesal Penal text is Ley 63 de 2008 as published in Gaceta Oficial 26114 of 29 August 2008, from the Legispan
record of the Asamblea Nacional published on the Órgano Judicial's website
(https://www.organojudicial.gob.pa/uploads/wp_repo/uploads/2016/11/C%C3%B3digo-Procesal-Penal.pdf), retrieved
30 October 2026 from an archived copy. The site states no licence.

The Código del Trabajo text is the Ministerio de Trabajo y Desarrollo Laboral / OIT edition published on the Órgano
Judicial's website (https://www.organojudicial.gob.pa/uploads/wp_repo/uploads/2016/11/c%C3%B3digo-detrabajo.pdf),
retrieved 30 October 2026 from an archived copy. The site states no licence.

Changes made by Lexifina: the text was converted to one Markdown file per article; page headers and footers, title and
chapter headings and the edition's editorial footnotes were removed; line breaks within a paragraph were joined. The
wording of the law was not changed. The Asamblea Nacional does not endorse this repository.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages and the tools) are dedicated to the
public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
